<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND ALL OUT FOR 249 V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND ALL OUT FOR 249 V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out for 249 in their first innings on the second day of the second cricket test against Pakistan on Friday.</p>
</text>
